/T (Cases \(or stands\) must be lifted from the long side by placing 2.5 m long forks under them. Slabs must be vertically handled and, in case of bridges, the slinging must be made using hemp cloth \(steel chains are not recommended\) to prevent any breakage and/or chipping. In case of storage on metal stands, the latter should be coated \(wood or rubber\).)
/E (Cases \(or stands\) must be lifted from the long side by placing 2.5 m long forks under them. Slabs must be vertically handled and, in case of bridges, the slinging must be made using hemp cloth \(steel chains are not recommended\) to prevent any breakage and/or chipping. In case of storage on metal stands, the latter should be coated \(wood or rubber\).)
