/Title (Cases \(or stands\) must be lifted from the long side by placing 2.5 m long forks under them. Slabs must be vertically handled and, in case of bridges, the slinging must be made using hemp cloth \(steel chains are not recommended\) to prevent any breakage and/or chipping. In case of storage on metal stands, the latter should be coated \(wood or rubber\).)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 5462 0 R
/Prev 5580 0 R
/Next 5639 0 R
>>
endobj
5639 0 obj
<<
/Title (For multiple grabs, the use of a lifting beam is advised, with canvas straps spaced out on the base and on the top by a wooden spacer slightly longer than the slab pack \(as shown in figure 2\). In this way the tension generated during handling is no applied to the slabs, avoiding the breakage of the material.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 5462 0 R
/Prev 5638 0 R
/Next 5581 0 R
>>
endobj
